{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281170","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1028117001:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌ、ライカのことは覚えてますか？彼女ヴィジランツになったんですよ！それにブライアンも風語りの仲間入りをしたんです！","source_cn":"伊温，你还记得莱卡吗？她成为薄暮巡游者了！布莱恩也加入...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD19762AF4F18CC54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028117002:0":{"text":"ライカお姉さんとブライアンお兄さんですか？二人ともすごい……","source_cn":"莱卡姐姐和布莱恩大哥吗？他们都好棒啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CEF7845A8D98E9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028117003:0":{"text":"あと、クインもアルドン様のお弟子さんになったんですよ。でもクインは型破りだから、どっちかが先に参るでしょうねぇ。","source_cn":"还有洛桑，雅顿大人收了他当学生，虽然不知道更头疼的会是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD756658F810A4568","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028117004:0":{"text":"聞いた話だと、クインは森の外に行きたくて仕方がないそうで、そのたびにアルドン様が耳を引っ張って連れ戻すんだとか。","source_cn":"我听说呀，他做梦都想去丛林外闯荡，被雅顿大人揪着耳朵拎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD475D1A8802D2845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028117005:0":{"text":"森の外……","source_cn":"去丛林外……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B24B9AAF069A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028117006:0":{"text":"そうだ、イヴォンヌも外に行ってみたいですか？","source_cn":"对了，伊温，你想出去看看吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE87EFFF33CA6C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028117007:0":{"text":"え？外に？","source_cn":"诶，出去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0337FF6901F6530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028117008:0":{"text":"ええ、バドーゾ山脈の外、エスペリアの他の場所へ行って、海や湖を見るんです。","source_cn":"嗯，去瓦度索山脉之外，伊索米亚的其他地方，去看看大海和湖泊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8E179D0EEC95C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028117009:0":{"text":"私は……","source_cn":"我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4B7C9EF853FF48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028117010:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:回忆中的芙拉贝尔":{"text":"記憶の中のフラベル","source":"回忆中的芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker: